75
00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:00.920
Watch your back.

76
00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.280
General.

77
00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.680
[David] So. ChloÃ©?

78
00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:11.640
Yeah.

79
00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:12.920
What?

80
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.960
I don't know.
Maybe a clue. a lead. a suspect? Whatever?

81
00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.160
Right. We've got someone.

82
00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.920
This guy.
The terrorist in the fridge truck.

83
00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.080
The one with the cap.

84
00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.320
- We ID'd him from his tattoo.
- [David] That on the right?

85
00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.800
[ChloÃ©] Yeah.
